{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 2, "text": "用钱为他们赎身。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 249, "w": 318, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "用钱为他们赎身。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 249, "w": 318, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 3, "text": "亭目的家奴多为女性，她们是亭目家中的侍者，由亭目花钱买来，无人身自由。其家", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 314, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "亭目的家奴多为女性，她们是亭目家中的侍者，由亭目花钱买来，无人身自由。其家", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 314, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 4, "text": "属有钱时可将她们赎回。家奴到结婚年龄时，亭目或将她们卖给人为妻，或让男女家奴", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 382, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "属有钱时可将她们赎回。家奴到结婚年龄时，亭目或将她们卖给人为妻，或让男女家奴", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 382, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 5, "text": "自相婚配。", "bbox_px": {"x": 132, "y": 450, "w": 181, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "自相婚配。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 132, "y": 450, "w": 181, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 6, "text": "土司亭目是基层统治者，同时也是土地所有者。亭目得到土司的分封，可以世袭。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 519, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "土司亭目是基层统治者，同时也是土地所有者。亭目得到土司的分封，可以世袭。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 519, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 7, "text": "他们一方面行使封建王朝给予他们的权力，另一方面却享有独立的司法权，自设衙门和", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 579, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "他们一方面行使封建王朝给予他们的权力，另一方面却享有独立的司法权，自设衙门和", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 579, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 8, "text": "监狱。以他们的个人意志为法律，随时审讯、关押无辜百姓，甚至对百姓施以严刑。百姓", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 652, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "监狱。以他们的个人意志为法律，随时审讯、关押无辜百姓，甚至对百姓施以严刑。百姓", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 652, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 9, "text": "丧失了基本的政治权利和人身自由。①对百姓还有许多行为上的限制：", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 712, "w": 1234, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "丧失了基本的政治权利和人身自由。①对百姓还有许多行为上的限制：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 712, "w": 1234, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 10, "text": "（1）百姓的房屋不能开正门，只能开侧门，不准用石灰糊墙和瓦口。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 785, "w": 1154, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（1）百姓的房屋不能开正门，只能开侧门，不准用石灰糊墙和瓦口。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 785, "w": 1154, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 11, "text": "（2）骑马不准用红坐褥马鞍，见亭目族人要低头让路，求见亭目时要叩头下跪。②", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 845, "w": 1391, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（2）骑马不准用红坐褥马鞍，见亭目族人要低头让路，求见亭目时要叩头下跪。②", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 845, "w": 1391, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 12, "text": "（3）妇女头发要挽髻，不准下垂，不准穿绸缎衣料。③", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 905, "w": 905, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（3）妇女头发要挽髻，不准下垂，不准穿绸缎衣料。③", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 905, "w": 905, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 13, "text": "（4） 亭目可以任意打骂、监禁或赶走农民，但不得处死。亭目对庶民打骂庶民不能还", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 978, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（4） 亭目可以任意打骂、监禁或赶走农民，但不得处死。亭目对庶民打骂庶民不能还", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 978, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 14, "text": "手④。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1046, "w": 96, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "手④。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1046, "w": 96, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 15, "text": "（5）农民生男育女要向亭目申报送礼⑤。婚姻方面，庶民不能与亭目阶层婚配，庶民", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1106, "w": 1463, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（5）农民生男育女要向亭目申报送礼⑤。婚姻方面，庶民不能与亭目阶层婚配，庶民", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1106, "w": 1463, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 16, "text": "生育子女要向亭目申报并送礼物。◎", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1179, "w": 623, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "生育子女要向亭目申报并送礼物。◎", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1179, "w": 623, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 17, "text": "（6）庶民求见亭目时要叩头。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1247, "w": 503, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（6）庶民求见亭目时要叩头。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1247, "w": 503, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 18, "text": "（7）农民死人停丧时只能横着停棺，亭目宗族停丧可顺直停棺和披麻戴孝⑦。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1308, "w": 1331, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（7）农民死人停丧时只能横着停棺，亭目宗族停丧可顺直停棺和披麻戴孝⑦。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1308, "w": 1331, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 19, "text": "（8）过年时农民要向亭目拜年和送礼（一般送大雄鸡一只，酒三至五斤）。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1380, "w": 1262, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（8）过年时农民要向亭目拜年和送礼（一般送大雄鸡一只，酒三至五斤）。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1380, "w": 1262, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 20, "text": "（9）亭目子女不与农民子女婚配。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1448, "w": 583, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（9）亭目子女不与农民子女婚配。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1448, "w": 583, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 21, "text": "（10）农民子女不准读书，不准取学名。⑧ 庶民子弟不准读书，取学名。⑨", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1509, "w": 1230, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（10）农民子女不准读书，不准取学名。⑧ 庶民子弟不准读书，取学名。⑨", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1509, "w": 1230, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 22, "text": "在称呼上也有一些例规，如称领主“布苏”、“苏旁”、“苏难”、“苏他”；称其子女为", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1577, "w": 1459, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "在称呼上也有一些例规，如称领主“布苏”、“苏旁”、“苏难”、“苏他”；称其子女为", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1577, "w": 1459, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 23, "text": "“况”", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1641, "w": 105, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“况”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1641, "w": 105, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 24, "text": "、“囊”，自称为“唯”", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1641, "w": 346, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“囊”，自称为“唯”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1641, "w": 346, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 25, "text": "在宗教信仰方面，平时要祭三种神祇，即白牛神、黑牛神、女人庙。每年三月三或久", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1714, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在宗教信仰方面，平时要祭三种神祇，即白牛神、黑牛神、女人庙。每年三月三或久", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1714, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 26, "text": "晴不雨就要祭这些神。相传祭祀都与王氏亭目的祖先有关。而王氏祖先王夙若所种的", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1774, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "晴不雨就要祭这些神。相传祭祀都与王氏亭目的祖先有关。而王氏祖先王夙若所种的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1774, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 27, "text": "树和黄氏亭目十二世黄毅的葬地也奉为神灵。在祭祀中还有若干仪式和禁忌，如饭前要", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1839, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "树和黄氏亭目十二世黄毅的葬地也奉为神灵。在祭祀中还有若干仪式和禁忌，如饭前要", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1839, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 281, "line_no": 28, "text": "放铁炮，饭后要大叫三声才能散席，杀牛要留牯脏祭母神。①0", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1907, "w": 1033, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "放铁炮，饭后要大叫三声才能散席，杀牛要留牯脏祭母神。①0", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1907, "w": 1033, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
